B.a1T=s(["Total Population: 13,83,727 (Males: 7,13,912; Females: 6,69,815).","Decadal Population Growth (2001-2011): 26.03%.","Overall Sex Ratio: 938 females per 1000 males (Child Sex Ratio: 972).","Overall Literacy: 65.38% (Male: 72.55%, Female: 57.70%).","Highest Literacy District: Papum Pare (79.95%), followed by Lower Subansiri (74.35%) and East Siang (72.54%).","Highest Population Growth Rate: Kurung Kumey (116.56%).","Religious Demographics (2011 Census): Christian: 30.26% (418,732), Hindu: 29.04% (401,876), Indigenous Donyi-Polo & Other Religions: 26.20% (362,553), Buddhist: 11.77% (162,815), Muslim: 1.95% (27,045)."],t.s)
