B.a1B=s(["Newton's Laws: 1st Law (Inertia), 2nd Law (F = ma, definition of Force), 3rd Law (Action-Reaction).","Universal Gravitation: Gravitational force F = G(m1*m2)/r^2, where G = 6.674 * 10^-11 N m^2/kg^2.","Speed of Light: 3 * 10^8 m/s in vacuum; Sound cannot travel through vacuum and requires a material medium (fastest in solids).","pH Scale: 0 to 14 (pH < 7 acidic, pH = 7 neutral, pH > 7 basic/alkaline). Human blood pH is ~7.4.","Baking Soda: Sodium Hydrogen Carbonate (NaHCO3); Washing Soda: Hydrated Sodium Carbonate (Na2CO3.10H2O).","Bleaching Powder: Calcium Hypochlorite (CaOCl2); Plaster of Paris: Calcium Sulfate Hemihydrate (CaSO4.1/2H2O).","Greenhouse Gases: Carbon Dioxide (CO2), Methane (CH4), Nitrous Oxide (N2O), Water Vapor."],t.s)
